      "content": "Our management is deeply concerned to learn that approximately 15 guests at the Crestview Azure Resort may have food poisoning symptoms following last night's buffet, and we are personally concerned. We have immediately suspended food service operations, notified local health authorities, and launched a comprehensive investigation while reviewing our food safety protocols. While we take full responsibility for this incident and remain open to all feedback from affected guests, we will share further details only as information becomes available. We are committed to resolving this swiftly and safely to ensure the health and satisfaction of our community moving forward.",
